WEBVTT

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.020
The first round

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.830
of the Vanguard Championship 
Third Kanto Region Tournament!

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:10.980
It's Team Quadrifoglio versus Team Fragrance!

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:14.390
Everyone's attention here is 
focused on this first round

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.360
with the winners from last time, Team Q4!

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:22.210
Naturally, all teams have their 
hearts set on defeating Q4!

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:35.510
I heard the voice of the card...

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:40.470
I see. I'll win if you're with me.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:47.330
Begin the match!

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:49.330
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.080
I redrew my hand, but...

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:34.820
He doesn't have any grade 3 units.

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.890
I know it by your scent...

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:43.680
Even though you redrew, it seems 
you've got a bad hand, huh?

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:49.270
Dangerous Scent

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:51.800
I ride Little Sage, Marron!

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:55.860
Then I activate Barcgal's skill...

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.470
Flogal goes to the Rear-guard!

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:07.560
I ride Oracle Guardian, Gemini!

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:11.610
I attack your Vanguard!

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:19.770
I'm not getting any grade 3s...

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:26.190
I use Barcgal's skill to call Llew!

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:31.210
Then, Llew's Counterblast!

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.820
Stand up, my avatar!

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:35.420
Superior Ride!

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:37.470
Blaster Blade!

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:43.510
Still, that Superior Ride has a drawback.

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:47.110
Your Rear-guard diminishes and you 
don't get to attack right away.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.820
I call Wingal!

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:56.260
I attack your Vanguard with Blaster Blade!

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:59.210
With Wingal's skill, his 
power increases to 19000!

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:01.370
Drive trigger check!

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:04.500
Yes! Grade 3!

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:15.630
I ride Oracle Guardian, Wiseman!

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:24.740
I call Oracle Guardians Red Eye and Blue Eye!

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:32.820
Wiseman and Red Eye, attack Blaster Blade!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.240
Drive trigger check!

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:40.310
What the heck?! He's being 
attacked left and right!

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:42.850
Maybe he's got some kind of plan...

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:54.520
It did come!

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.770
Gancelot...

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.350
Did you show it to me?

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:17.860
I see. I'll win if you're with me.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:25.300
Puzzled, surprised, pleased... 
He has a blended scent...

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.300
Give me power!

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:31.280
White wings of noble pride!

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:35.090
I ride Solitary Knight, Gancelot!

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.530
I call King of Knights, Alfred!

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:46.460
Two grade 3s coming out together!

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:48.020
Alfred is in the Rear-guard?!

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:53.340
In this situation, with few allies 
out there, it's no mistake.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.670
Gancelot's Counterblast!

00:05:56.850 --> 00:06:00.740
When Blaster Blade is in the Soul, 
Gancelot gets +5000 power...

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:02.390
...and the +1 critical!

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:06.670
I attack Wiseman with 
Gancelot, boosted by Wingal!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:09.030
I guard with Battle Sister, Chocolat!

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.010
Perfect defense!

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:18.970
I attack with Alfred!

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:26.930
Damage trigger check...

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.410
I ride Oracle Guardian, Apollon!

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:37.280
I call Meteor Break Wizard and Gemini!

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:45.110
I attack Gancelot with 
Meteor Break, boosted by Gemini!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.870
Meteor Break's Counterblast.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.570
+3000 power...

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.400
Damage trigger check!

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:02.920
I attack with Apollon!

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:05.530
I guard with Yggdrasil Maiden, Elaine!

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:07.550
Twin drive check...

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:14.610
I attack with Red Eye, boosted by Blue Eye!

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:21.780
Damage trigger check!

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:27.120
Just 1 more damage... 
The end is in sight, eh?

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:29.340
I'm not giving up until it's over!

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.360
It seems like you're serious...

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:35.800
That's fine. You can struggle in vain.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:40.890
I call Marron, Swordsman of the Blaze, 
Palamedes, and Young Pegasus Knight!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.710
Five units in the Rear-guard...

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:45.410
If only Alfred was Vanguard...

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:50.560
True, he could have chosen to ride 
Alfred instead of Gancelot...

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:55.270
I should have taught Aichi 
more about grade 3s!

00:07:55.940 --> 00:07:58.230
Gancelot's Counterblast!

00:07:58.230 --> 00:07:59.700
+5000 power!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.460
+1 critical!

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:09.470
I attack Apollon with Palamedes, 
boosted by Pegasus Knight!

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:11.340
I activate Palamedes's skill!

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:15.020
When I have two or more 
grade 3 Royal Paladins,

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.640
Palamedes gets +3000 power!

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:20.400
No guard!

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:24.990
Damage trigger check!

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:28.190
I attack with Alfred, boosted by Marron!

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:33.810
If this hits, he can attack next 
with Gancelot and his 2 critical!

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:36.790
Aichi! Show him the power of grade 3s!

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:39.930
I guard with Victory 
Maker and Faithful Angel.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.800
That's too bad.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.040
What the heck is he doing?!

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.240
Aichi...

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.750
Even so, I believe in you!

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.860
I attack Apollon with 
Gancelot, boosted by Wingal!

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.770
As long as he doesn't draw a trigger...

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:11.050
Drive trigger, first check!

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.330
Good...

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:14.290
Second check!

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:18.950
Critical trigger!

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:23.150
I give the +5000 power and 
+1 critical to Gancelot!

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:31.430
It's not over yet...

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.480
Damage trigger, triple check!

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:41.020
This is my last chance...

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:44.900
Draw trigger...

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.570
The winner is Aichi Sendou!

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:54.040
Yeah!!

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:55.660
I did it!

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.920
I lost?!

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:02.430
Aichi Sendou from Team Q4 is the winner!

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:04.190
They won, huh, Big Brother?

00:10:04.190 --> 00:10:07.160
It wouldn't do if they 
lost in the first round.

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:09.350
You did it, Brother!

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:10.870
Y-Yeah...

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:14.130
Looks like that special 
training at camp paid off.

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:15.600
Uh huh...

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:18.930
Brother!

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:20.480
Aichi!

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:22.010
Are you okay?

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:26.840
I guess I was nervous...

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:29.430
And it's exhausted me...

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:31.040
Do you want to go to the infirmary?

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:34.560
No. I'll be fine after I rest a little while.

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:37.090
Aichi...

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:39.380
Then please relax here.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:41.640
If anything happens, I'll 
call us straight away.

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:42.630
Okay.

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:45.250
Brother, please leave the rest to me!

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:46.490
Sure.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:55.430
Come to think of it, this kind 
of thing has happened before...

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:56.240
When?

00:10:57.150 --> 00:11:01.070
He said his head hurt after watching 
the fight with Ren Suzugamori.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.070
Ren?

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:09.600
Does that ring any bells?

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.410
Thank you.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:17.020
Instead of Aichi getting stronger,

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:20.560
it's much more likely that he's 
losing himself in that power.

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:24.150
But it's still too early 
to jump to conclusions.

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:27.130
I'll have to keep my eye on 
him for a little longer...

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:31.590
Aichi Sendou has come through 
with a brilliant win!

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:34.010
Sounds like he's gotten a little better.

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:38.150
Huh? Do you think he's...?

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:39.420
Impossible.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:47.920
Where am I?!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.680
The second match is up next!

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:03.770
Q4's Misaki Tokura versus Fragrance's Toilettete!

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:06.660
Here's our main interest.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:24.010
The scent of roses elevates one's mood.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:25.990
Victory is mine!

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.340
Begin the match!

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.490
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.580
I call Battle Sister, Cocoa.

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:42.270
Using Cocoa's skill, I get to 
look at the top card of my deck.

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.380
I'm putting it back on top.

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:49.100
I smell a trap...

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:52.280
She had the choice to put the card back 
on top of the deck or on the bottom.

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:55.290
On top means it's probably a trigger...

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:59.040
I attack Monkey Rue with 
Red Eye, boosted by Cocoa!

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.150
I could guard with Alabaster Owl...

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:05.780
But this time...

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:07.760
No guard!

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:14.140
Now she has 5 damage! Just one more!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:17.360
But the power of the Goddess 
of the Full Moon, Tsukuyomi,

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:19.920
even when boosted by Nike, is only 14000.

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:23.350
And even when she draws the 
trigger, that'll make it 19000.

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:25.220
I'll be able to guard with Alabaster.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:29.370
If she gives that trigger to 
Gemini, that makes it only 13000.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.510
I could guard against it with Margal.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.410
I activate Red Eye's skill.

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:37.190
When this unit's attack 
hits, I can Soulcharge.

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:41.110
Goddess of the Crescent Moon, Tsukuyomi?!

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:42.880
It wasn't a trigger?!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.970
Goddess of the Full Moon, Tsukuyomi,

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:47.830
receives the power of Crescent Moon, 
increasing her power to 11000!

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:50.150
That's what you were after?!

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:52.800
Oracle Guardian, Nike boosts!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.270
Goddess of the Full Moon attacks!

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:57.780
Her power is 16000.

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:02.130
If I figure in the possibility of her pulling a 
trigger, Alabaster won't be enough to protect me!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.960
I guard with Alabaster and Margal!

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:08.050
Drive trigger check...

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.120
Draw trigger.

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:16.270
I give the +5000 power to Gemini...

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:17.120
...and draw!

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:18.350
What?!

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.250
I attack with Gemini!

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:24.760
No guard...

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:28.840
Damage trigger check!

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:36.080
The winner of the second 
match is Misaki Tokura!

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:39.200
With a score of 2-0, Q4 is the victor!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:46.500
Team Q4, the mighty champions of our previous 
tournament, have smoothly won this first round!

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:50.810
So after riding Full Moon, she 
Soulcharged Crescent Moon!

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:52.380
Not too shabby!

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:55.510
I didn't have an eye on her for nothing!

00:14:57.310 --> 00:14:59.880
Then she does have that power...

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.150
We did it, Brother!

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:04.120
Yeah! Thanks.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.770
Sure, Brother!

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.080
Q4...

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:13.910
Enjoy it while you can...

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.390
He did it!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.020
The winner is Gouki Daimonji!

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:32.800
Team Handsome has made 
it to the second round!

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:34.920
The semifinals are coming up next!

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:38.500
Looks like for the finals,

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:40.160
Infirmary

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.070
we'll be fighting Team Handsome!

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:42.790
Gouki, you really are strong!

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.560
Of course!

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.390
He does everything at full 
power and full throttle!

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:48.940
You sure are a lazy one!

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:52.310
Layin' in bed, and you expect to fight us?

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:54.400
Sorry. But...

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.890
We're going to win for sure!

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.430
We're going to win, then go to the finals!

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:00.920
Keep that promise.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.250
See you later, darling!

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:04.880
Kiss!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.470
Nagisa, what a brat!

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:15.670
Everyone... um...

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:18.400
I'm sorry I spoke for all of you...

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:20.630
You have nothing to apologize for.

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:23.430
That's right! I'm glad you said it!

00:16:23.430 --> 00:16:26.060
But for the next match too, I'll be...

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:29.460
I'll keep our winning streak 
going for you, Brother!

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:31.890
So please rest until you feel better.

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:32.990
Thank you.

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.260
Kai...

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:43.210
Begin the match!

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:45.070
Stand up the Vanguard!

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:46.950
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:50.920
Win for Brother Aichi, or else!

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:54.610
Final Turn!

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:58.050
Soulblast! Vortex Dragon!

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:04.680
With the hellfire that whirls through the 
battlefield, burn everything in this world to ashes!

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:05.710
Burning Hell!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.140
Three of your Rear-guards retire!

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:15.870
What?!

00:17:16.190 --> 00:17:20.310
I attack with Dual Axe Archdragon, 
boosted by Embodiment of Armor, Bahr!

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:22.990
I guard with Lucky Girl!

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:27.070
Your power is 18000. Mine is 20000.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.260
You must be rattled, 
because you miscalculated.

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:35.480
If the opponent's Rear-guard has two or 
fewer cards, Dual Axe Archdragon gets +3000 power.

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:37.620
Its total power is 21000!

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:39.050
What?!

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:44.790
Fall asleep in terror, despair and 
everlasting pain carved with its dual axe!

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.270
Dual Axe Bomber!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.310
The winner is Kai Toshiki!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:03.140
A resounding victory! Team Q4 
has won their second round!

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:06.840
Team Q4
Team Cheergirls
Team Handsome
Team Avengers

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:08.090
We're finally down to the best four!

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:10.350
That includes Q4, the champions 
from our previous tournament,

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:13.210
and the runners-up, Team Handsome!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:16.910
Will these two teams end 
up advancing to the finals,

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:19.070
or will there be a new force to reckon with?

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:21.430
The semifinal matches will 
take place simultaneously.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.840
Begin the match!

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:28.780
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:30.750
Go! Go! Kamui the Great!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.880
Do your best! DB, yo!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.670
You root for him, too!

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:37.160
I am... in my head.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:42.700
I activate Ultimate Lifeform, Cosmo Lord!

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:46.200
By resting a Rear-guard, 
this gains +3000 power!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:49.630
I rest Battleraizer!

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:53.210
Death Army Guy!

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:57.900
I'm having Battleraizer exit the field...

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:59.810
...and then I call Death Army Lady!

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:01.660
Don't tell me...!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.700
That's right! I rest Death Army Lady!

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:09.020
Then I attack your Vanguard with 
Cosmo Lord, boosted by Tough Boy!

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:15.400
The total power is 27000!

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:18.090
Even if I guard with Herbivorous 
Dragon, Brutesaurus

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.560
and Raging Dragon, Sparksaurus, 
I only have 20000!

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:25.120
If I also intercept with Raging Dragon, 
Blastsaurus, it still only brings me up to 25000!

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:27.120
I can't protect myself!

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:29.120
No guard.

00:19:30.820 --> 00:19:33.480
I'm gonna knock you to 
the end of the universe!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:36.310
Dangerous Cosmo Storm!

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:41.310
Damage trigger check!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:47.250
The winner is Kamui Katsuragi!

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:51.420
Team Q4 advances to the finals!

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:56.310
Q4's level itself has advanced <i>oh</i> so 
much since their last tournament here.

00:19:56.470 --> 00:19:57.430
Indeed!

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:00.780
We've got one fight left in the semifinals!

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:02.470
Q4 is going to battle...

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:05.320
...either Handsome or Avengers!

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:11.560
Lend me your power again.

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:16.870
Kai...

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:19.570
I'm all right now!

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:21.710
You don't have to fight any more today.

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.460
But I want to fight!

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:27.580
Because I want your recognition...

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:33.370
I can... I can hear a voice...

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:38.140
And then, during the actual fight, 
that unit becomes the key.

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:42.570
It's like the cards are 
lending me their power...

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:48.190
Is this what you were talking about 
when you told me to "picture it", Kai?

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:48.950
No!

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:58.780
Kai...?

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:00.840
Don't forget...

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:02.920
<i>You're</i> the one who fights!

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:07.430
Oh my gosh! Brother!

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:08.850
Gouki and the others...!

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:11.420
You're not gonna tell me that Handsome lost?

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:14.530
When we went to watch the 
match, it was already over...

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:17.770
I don't believe it. I mean, <i>Gouki</i>?!

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:22.090
I'm sorry. I couldn't keep 
up my end of the deal.

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:25.830
Nagisa...

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:27.600
They're strong...

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:28.880
Don't be careless.

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:31.220
We'll win. We'll definitely win!

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:38.100
Final

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:42.090
The time has come for the final round of the 
Vanguard Championship Third Kanto Region Tournament!

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:48.100
It's between Team Quadrifoglio, Q4, 
the champions of our last tournament,

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:50.030
and, appearing for the first time,

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:52.380
Team Avengers!

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:55.330
"Avenge" means "to take revenge"...

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:58.050
I've heard that voice before...

00:21:58.220 --> 00:22:02.550
Yes. I've come to take revenge on you, Q4!

00:22:05.480 --> 00:22:08.010
It looks like you remember me.

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:10.100
That's right. It's me.

00:22:10.450 --> 00:22:13.980
Kyou, the guy you fought 
at the national tournament.

00:23:53.790 --> 00:23:58.290
Is it because of training camp? Fights are 
actually going the way I want them to...

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:01.050
Our opponent is Team Avengers?

00:24:01.050 --> 00:24:03.760
That guy is AL4's Crusher Kyou!

00:24:05.220 --> 00:24:07.080
The time has come!

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:10.420
Team Q4, how have you all been?!

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:12.130
Next time: Kyou's Revenge!

00:24:12.420 --> 00:24:17.050
I'm sure when Kai talked about "picturing 
this" and getting strong, this is what he meant!
